regress/artifacts/sgirandomcolour\pass2_20260910\codex.txt:4074:That collides with `SGIRE_W_TEX_RD`. Every existing session avoids firing that warning before its colour decline. In particular, **`latch indep` stays green at 1**, because it primes bit 10, not bit 11. All destination and remaining diagnostic checks retain their expected results.
regress/artifacts/sgirandomcolour\pass2_20260910\codex.txt:4076:An ordinary texture-read decline in another session would then suppress the colour announcement. The missing measurement is a texture-read decline followed by an unsupported-colour PUT in the same instance. I did not build this mutant.
