codex
The source tests TLB_A, TLB_B, TLB_C, and LIN_A separately, but it never tests `bufdepth == 4`: depth is used in arithmetic and as the transfer length. The existing setup also programs only LIN_A. Changing its mode to `0x00f0` alone would leave TLB_A invalid and return before the colour switch, so the corner needs a valid tiled mapping and a reachability check.

